            <p class="t-mono test-label" data-i18n="fcF1l">Fix 01</p>
            <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="fcF1xt">Tags in the description</h3>
            <p data-i18n="fcF1x">We moved the tags into the video description.</p>
            <div class="test-img">
              <img
                class="lt"
                src="/assets/foca-fix1.webp"
                data-i18n-alt="fcAltF1"
