            <p class="t-mono test-label" data-i18n="fcI2l">Issue 02</p>
            <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="fcI2t">Smart, but not understood</h3>
            <p data-i18n="fcI2">
              Onboarding asked users to add fixed daily tasks per weekday with start and end times. Rule-based
              logic then found free windows and suggested a matching study activity, like a short video during a
              30-minute break. In 2 of the 4 tests, users couldn’t understand how to use it.
            </p>
            <div class="test-img">
              <img
