          <p data-i18n="fcD4">
            Studying for a concurso (public service exam) is a long haul, so small wins matter. When candidates
            complete their daily study time, a celebration screen marks it with a summary of the day and an option
            to share. It only appears after they finish the current study activity, so it never interrupts a
            lesson or a simulado.
